WEBVTT

00:15.670 --> 00:19.320
[Eight years ago]

00:18.000 --> 00:18.550
Come in.

00:23.960 --> 00:24.510
Mom.

00:26.550 --> 00:27.120
Come on.

00:27.480 --> 00:27.960
Mom.

00:28.070 --> 00:29.270
Feiyan, you're back.

00:31.700 --> 00:32.180
Come.

00:33.470 --> 00:34.070
Slow down.

00:34.280 --> 00:35.280
Who is this?

00:37.280 --> 00:38.110
This is the one

00:38.670 --> 00:39.980
I often mentioned to you,

00:39.980 --> 00:40.830
the young master of the Wang family,

00:40.830 --> 00:41.630
Wang Jiaxian.

00:41.850 --> 00:42.640
Jiaxian.

00:45.450 --> 00:46.380
Go pour some tea.

00:48.320 --> 00:48.710
Have a seat.

00:48.710 --> 00:49.390
Jiaxian.

00:49.930 --> 00:50.400
Come.

00:50.920 --> 00:51.350
Sit.

00:56.150 --> 00:56.680
Jiaxian,

00:57.360 --> 00:59.280
Feiyan has had a hard life.

00:59.960 --> 01:02.390
She may look glamorous on stage,

01:02.880 --> 01:03.680
but off stage,

01:04.120 --> 01:05.430
she still has to make a living

01:05.430 --> 01:07.510
by pleasing others every day.

01:08.350 --> 01:09.840
She is all alone,

01:10.150 --> 01:11.350
with no one to rely on.

01:12.120 --> 01:13.400
After she met you,

01:14.050 --> 01:14.930
only then

01:15.310 --> 01:17.310
does she have something to live for.

01:19.120 --> 01:19.640
Mom,

01:20.120 --> 01:21.230
don't say that.

01:22.150 --> 01:22.710
Here.

01:25.480 --> 01:26.170
Easy, easy.

01:32.070 --> 01:32.640
Mom.

01:32.870 --> 01:33.580
I'll go get a doctor.

01:33.580 --> 01:34.270
I'll go.

01:34.930 --> 01:35.520
Don't go.

01:36.410 --> 01:37.970
I don't have much time left.

01:38.710 --> 01:40.170
Don't waste any more money

01:40.680 --> 01:41.759
on my illness.

01:43.229 --> 01:43.710
Sit.

01:45.950 --> 01:46.479
Mom.

01:47.430 --> 01:49.509
My illness has dragged you down.

01:49.840 --> 01:50.840
Don't say that.

01:51.310 --> 01:52.970
This kid is so strong-willed.

01:53.350 --> 01:54.950
She bears all the suffering

01:55.280 --> 01:56.800
and hardships by herself.

01:57.860 --> 01:59.460
She never tells me anything.

01:59.710 --> 02:00.280
Mom.

02:01.710 --> 02:02.560
Jiaxian.

02:03.790 --> 02:04.450
From now on,

02:04.870 --> 02:06.600
I'll leave Feiyan in your care.

02:07.480 --> 02:09.750
I hope you take good care of her.

02:10.310 --> 02:11.110
Rest assured.

02:13.750 --> 02:15.950
I will definitely take good care of her.

02:16.360 --> 02:17.030
Good.

02:19.360 --> 02:20.150
Good.

02:21.470 --> 02:22.470
I always thought

02:22.710 --> 02:23.840
this day would come.

02:25.430 --> 02:26.630
But I didn't expect it

02:27.079 --> 02:28.190
to come so soon.

02:29.240 --> 02:30.120
Do it.

02:30.610 --> 02:31.560
I won't say

02:32.130 --> 02:33.260
a word of complaint.

02:33.820 --> 02:34.780
No rush.

02:36.840 --> 02:38.640
Just put on an act with me for now.

02:40.010 --> 02:41.470
If you don't kill me today,

02:42.180 --> 02:44.040
aren't you afraid I'll report you

02:44.040 --> 02:44.970
to Hu Guangyuan?

02:47.430 --> 02:48.310
You won't.

02:49.640 --> 02:52.170
Hu is still waiting
for his grandma to return.

02:55.680 --> 02:58.079
I'm just a lonely old woman.

02:58.100 --> 03:00.620
I've never heard of such a child.

03:01.050 --> 03:02.390
You're trying to fool me,

03:02.390 --> 03:03.590
but you're too green.

03:07.160 --> 03:08.790
You hid your grandson well,

03:09.430 --> 03:11.630
but with his congenital tuberculosis,

03:11.820 --> 03:14.550
he still needs to get his medicine
on time, right?

03:14.840 --> 03:16.000
What did you do to Hu?

03:17.680 --> 03:19.770
So scammers have feelings too.

03:28.750 --> 03:30.240
When you went after

03:30.240 --> 03:31.500
my brother and sister,

03:32.200 --> 03:33.880
why didn't you show any mercy?

03:36.800 --> 03:37.630
Is Hu...

03:40.750 --> 03:42.280
still alive?

03:47.470 --> 03:48.710
I'm not like you.

03:50.230 --> 03:52.090
Families shouldn't be involved.

03:54.310 --> 03:55.710
The barefoot doctor you found

03:55.710 --> 03:57.050
only treats symptoms
but not the root cause.

03:57.050 --> 03:59.910
I've found a doctor
who specializes in tuberculosis.

03:59.910 --> 04:02.060
When you and your grandson meet again,

04:02.400 --> 04:04.170
maybe you'll see

04:04.960 --> 04:06.520
a lively and healthy Hu.

04:07.240 --> 04:08.360
But before that,

04:09.070 --> 04:11.400
you have to play along
with me for this act.

04:12.150 --> 04:13.190
Where

04:13.590 --> 04:15.190
is Hu now?

04:20.089 --> 04:21.290
After it's done,

04:23.470 --> 04:25.030
I will tell you.

06:05.740 --> 06:09.740
[A Prophet]

06:10.420 --> 06:12.570
[Episode 2]

06:21.880 --> 06:23.390
Then I'll go back to the hotel.

06:23.390 --> 06:24.150
Shengxiang,

06:24.470 --> 06:26.400
keep Miss Chen company for a while.

06:27.640 --> 06:28.120
Mom,

06:28.680 --> 06:29.810
you go back and rest.

06:30.320 --> 06:31.150
I'll be back

06:31.730 --> 06:32.620
in a bit.

06:33.409 --> 06:34.060
Okay.

06:35.640 --> 06:36.570
Goodbye, Ma'am.

06:36.640 --> 06:37.470
Goodbye.

06:39.560 --> 06:40.390
Actually,

06:40.790 --> 06:42.880
you already knew
I was Lin Shengxiang, didn't you?

06:42.880 --> 06:43.390
Yes.

06:43.760 --> 06:45.390
Then why didn't you expose me?

06:45.390 --> 06:47.680
Because I think you're very interesting.

06:47.680 --> 06:48.740
Most importantly,

06:48.830 --> 06:50.030
I also wanted to know

06:50.520 --> 06:51.850
if the dignified Mr. Lin

06:52.000 --> 06:54.290
had any special way of hitting on women.

06:56.560 --> 06:57.520
So,

06:58.120 --> 06:59.520
is there any difference?

07:02.230 --> 07:03.760
You tell stories very well.

07:06.150 --> 07:06.750
By the way,

07:07.590 --> 07:08.790
you haven't finished

07:08.830 --> 07:10.090
telling me that story.

07:30.230 --> 07:30.960
Jiaxian.

07:32.880 --> 07:33.560
Stepmother.

07:33.560 --> 07:34.090
Brother.

07:34.150 --> 07:34.470
Aunt.

07:34.470 --> 07:34.880
Jialiang, Jiashu.

07:34.880 --> 07:35.640
Have a seat.

07:38.390 --> 07:39.320
The old man...

07:39.960 --> 07:40.690
didn't come?

07:42.560 --> 07:43.270
It's your father.

07:43.270 --> 07:44.330
Don't you know him?

07:44.470 --> 07:46.320
He tore up the wedding invitation
right away.

07:46.320 --> 07:47.440
He also ordered that no one

07:47.440 --> 07:49.120
should attend the wedding.

07:49.320 --> 07:52.050
Otherwise, they would be kicked out
of the house.

07:52.150 --> 07:53.210
Then how did you...

07:53.390 --> 07:55.640
You've called me Stepmother
for over 10 years.

07:55.640 --> 07:57.300
I have to come, no matter what.

07:57.830 --> 07:59.350
Just don't let him know.

07:59.760 --> 08:00.390
You two,

08:00.920 --> 08:02.250
don't talk nonsense when we get back.

08:02.250 --> 08:03.980
Brother, we won't tell Dad.

08:04.120 --> 08:04.790
Good girl.

08:05.120 --> 08:05.650
Jiaxian,

08:06.030 --> 08:06.940
the auspicious time is almost here.

08:06.940 --> 08:07.510
Let's go.

08:07.760 --> 08:08.120
Okay.

08:08.440 --> 08:09.370
I almost forgot.

08:09.760 --> 08:10.360
Take this.

08:10.610 --> 08:12.740
You two must live a good life together.

08:14.020 --> 08:15.480
Don't worry, Stepmother.

08:25.730 --> 08:29.280
♪ As sleeves rise and fall,
you glance is breathtaking ♪

08:29.300 --> 08:33.470
♪ You brush the dust away,
staying just for me ♪

08:33.490 --> 08:38.150
♪ I sing of spring on stage;
our eyes meet down below ♪

08:38.179 --> 08:41.150
♪ Our hearts silently align ♪

08:38.470 --> 08:39.559
The auspicious time has arrived.

08:39.559 --> 08:40.510
Bride and groom,

08:40.799 --> 08:42.039
first bow to heaven and earth!

08:42.039 --> 08:42.559
Great!

08:42.559 --> 08:43.750
-Great!
-Great!

08:43.150 --> 08:46.810
♪ I once sighed that
all love in plays was but fiction ♪

08:44.159 --> 08:45.800
Second bow to the parents!

08:45.920 --> 08:47.440
-Great!
-Great!

08:46.840 --> 08:50.490
♪ Now I know, amid crowds,
you'll grow old with me ♪

08:48.990 --> 08:50.510
Bow to each other!

08:51.170 --> 08:55.740
♪ Today I shed stage paint,
donning phoenix crown and red gown ♪

08:55.760 --> 08:59.420
♪ To meet your tender love ♪

08:59.440 --> 09:02.460
♪ You lift my veil and gaze into my eyes ♪

09:02.480 --> 09:05.440
♪ I bow softly,
toasting our years like wine ♪

09:05.460 --> 09:07.460
♪ On this blessed, auspicious day ♪

09:07.490 --> 09:11.670
♪ I'll wait for you,
with a grand bridal procession ♪

09:08.590 --> 09:10.080
Is the bride beautiful?

09:10.280 --> 09:11.740
-Beautiful!
-Beautiful!

09:12.870 --> 09:14.270
What are you waiting for?

09:14.400 --> 09:15.830
Hurry up and put it on me.

09:17.090 --> 09:21.480
♪ I bid wind and snow farewell,
set my opera robes aside, and run to you ♪

09:18.440 --> 09:19.710
Groom, Wang Jiaxian,

09:20.200 --> 09:21.600
and Bride, Jiang Feiyan.

09:21.640 --> 09:25.470
♪ We braided hair and tied our knots;
you could hold me close ♪

09:21.870 --> 09:23.320
A happy marriage.

09:23.510 --> 09:24.750
A match made in heaven.

09:24.750 --> 09:25.920
May they grow old together.

09:25.640 --> 09:29.230
♪ Red candles line the hall,
with wedding emblems intertwined ♪

09:26.160 --> 09:28.490
May their hearts be joined as one forever.

09:29.440 --> 09:34.230
♪ With blushing cheeks,
I entrust you my whole life ♪

09:33.400 --> 09:34.680
I had its band resized.

09:34.990 --> 09:35.470
Try it on.

09:35.070 --> 09:39.120
♪ I greet spring breeze, light
bright lamps, still waiting for you ♪

09:36.350 --> 09:37.320
But you've worn

09:38.280 --> 09:39.510
this watch for many years, right?

09:39.150 --> 09:42.800
♪ Lift the red silk and hand
our wedding quilt; can you see me? ♪

09:42.830 --> 09:46.720
♪ Through all worldly splendors,
I guard this warm moment ♪

09:44.230 --> 09:46.230
No matter what happened in the past,

09:46.280 --> 09:47.230
from now on,

09:46.950 --> 09:51.970
♪ Dawn and dusk,
we live in harmony year on year ♪

09:47.710 --> 09:49.280
every minute and second

09:50.750 --> 09:51.710
belongs to us.

10:01.160 --> 10:02.090
Jialiang, look.

10:02.280 --> 10:02.750
This

10:02.990 --> 10:04.450
is a birthday gift for you.

10:04.470 --> 10:05.470
Your brother said

10:05.510 --> 10:06.710
you like crickets the most.

10:06.710 --> 10:07.110
Look,

10:07.350 --> 10:08.040
open it,

10:08.160 --> 10:09.420
and you can put them in.

10:10.920 --> 10:11.920
So pretty.

10:12.470 --> 10:13.980
Thank you, Sister-in-Law.

10:13.980 --> 10:15.720
Sister-in-Law, I want a gift too.

10:15.720 --> 10:16.600
I want one too.

10:17.160 --> 10:18.090
You want one too?

10:18.870 --> 10:19.550
How about this?

10:19.550 --> 10:21.570
I'll make one for you
in the next few days.

10:21.570 --> 10:22.050
Okay?

10:22.080 --> 10:22.720
Okay.

10:23.920 --> 10:25.760
Longevity noodles are here!

10:25.780 --> 10:26.630
Noodles are here.

10:26.630 --> 10:27.320
Time to eat.

10:29.110 --> 10:31.110
Freshly cooked longevity noodles.

10:31.920 --> 10:32.560
Here.

10:33.630 --> 10:36.090
Let's serve a bowl
to our birthday boy first.

10:38.440 --> 10:39.320
Add some soup.

10:39.920 --> 10:41.230
Here, Birthday Boy.

10:42.710 --> 10:44.440
Sister-in-Law, you eat first.

10:46.630 --> 10:48.290
Sister-in-Law, here you are.

10:55.470 --> 10:56.000
Alright.

10:56.040 --> 10:58.350
The second bowl is for our birthday boy.

11:00.400 --> 11:01.590
Get some soup.

11:03.110 --> 11:04.570
Here you go, Birthday Boy.

11:05.360 --> 11:06.270
Chopsticks.

11:09.080 --> 11:10.160
I'll give you the third bowl, okay?

11:10.160 --> 11:10.750
Okay.

11:13.280 --> 11:14.110
And then what?

11:15.560 --> 11:16.350
That's it.

11:17.920 --> 11:18.920
That's all?

11:19.800 --> 11:20.920
A wedding night.

11:21.110 --> 11:22.080
Deeply in love,

11:22.400 --> 11:24.060
lovers finally tied the knot.

11:25.040 --> 11:26.770
Isn't this the perfect ending?

11:27.830 --> 11:30.290
It feels like
there were no twists and turns.

11:31.920 --> 11:34.120
Why do you need so many twists and turns?

11:35.040 --> 11:36.120
In this life,

11:36.990 --> 11:38.920
isn't living peacefully to the end

11:40.470 --> 11:41.630
the happiest thing?

11:42.680 --> 11:43.320
True.

12:19.590 --> 12:20.680
Behave yourself.

12:21.110 --> 12:22.310
Where is your mother?

12:22.870 --> 12:24.200
Speak! He's asking you!

12:24.320 --> 12:25.280
I don't know.

12:25.830 --> 12:27.860
We separated after she got in the car.

12:27.860 --> 12:29.900
Why are you playing dumb with me?

12:30.080 --> 12:31.440
I'm asking you where she is!

12:31.440 --> 12:33.320
I was with Miss Chen all night.

12:34.110 --> 12:36.110
Didn't you send someone to spy on me?

12:36.230 --> 12:37.560
Just ask him.

12:39.920 --> 12:40.350
No.

12:40.740 --> 12:43.340
You had dinner with Old Madam Zhu tonight.

12:44.160 --> 12:45.320
But on the way home,

12:45.320 --> 12:47.350
you suddenly changed rickshaws, right?

12:47.350 --> 12:48.750
Then you entered the downtown area

12:48.750 --> 12:49.920
and disappeared.

12:50.470 --> 12:51.200
Where is she?

12:52.080 --> 12:53.320
I'm asking you where she is!

12:53.320 --> 12:54.040
Where is she?

12:54.040 --> 12:54.990
As for her whereabouts,

12:54.990 --> 12:57.110
go ask her. How would I know?

12:57.400 --> 12:58.510
Anyway, you know

12:58.590 --> 12:59.630
the rules.

13:00.560 --> 13:02.510
Defectors face certain death.

13:02.870 --> 13:04.870
This had better
have nothing to do with you.

13:04.870 --> 13:06.600
Otherwise, no one can save you.

13:07.400 --> 13:07.800
Got...

13:08.560 --> 13:09.230
got it.

13:14.260 --> 13:14.810
Gui.

13:15.320 --> 13:16.720
Let him answer the phone.

13:18.110 --> 13:18.910
Go over there.

13:23.200 --> 13:23.600
Hello?

13:24.350 --> 13:26.080
Shengxiang, this is Qingying.

13:26.680 --> 13:28.350
About Song Tiezui you were looking for,

13:28.350 --> 13:30.350
my daddy asked around and found him.

13:30.680 --> 13:31.280
Really?

13:32.350 --> 13:34.830
Come to my house at 2:00 p.m. tomorrow,

13:35.160 --> 13:36.560
then I'll take you there.

13:36.960 --> 13:38.230
But that Song Tiezui

13:38.350 --> 13:40.160
will only give us half an hour,

13:40.350 --> 13:41.880
so you should prepare well.

13:42.100 --> 13:43.430
Okay. See you tomorrow.

13:43.760 --> 13:44.760
See you tomorrow.

13:50.530 --> 13:51.590
They took the bait.

13:52.390 --> 13:53.100
[Chen Residence]

13:59.160 --> 14:00.200
Please wait here.

14:00.200 --> 14:01.660
I'll go get the young lady.

14:04.990 --> 14:05.680
Master,

14:06.110 --> 14:08.070
Lin Shengxiang is new here.

14:08.200 --> 14:10.110
Even if he is the son
of a wealthy merchant,

14:10.110 --> 14:12.370
we don't need to bother
with his trivial matters

14:12.370 --> 14:13.970
and go to such great lengths.

14:16.920 --> 14:19.440
He's just a fledgling.

14:19.750 --> 14:22.040
He thinks leaving his father's control

14:22.230 --> 14:25.090
means he can achieve
great things in the vast world.

14:26.300 --> 14:28.000
The more eager he is for success,

14:28.000 --> 14:30.050
the more advantageous it is for us.

14:33.320 --> 14:34.200
Shengxiang,

14:34.440 --> 14:36.110
have you met that Song Tiezui?

14:37.040 --> 14:37.680
No.

14:38.520 --> 14:41.250
I've only heard my father
tell stories about him.

14:43.590 --> 14:44.990
To tell you the truth,

14:46.040 --> 14:46.990
these

14:47.400 --> 14:49.460
so-called fortune-telling masters

14:49.870 --> 14:52.470
are basically packaged charlatans,

14:52.550 --> 14:54.040
full of nonsense.

14:54.750 --> 14:56.230
You are still young.

14:56.480 --> 14:58.540
It's best not to get caught up in that.

14:59.160 --> 15:00.710
In the fortune-telling business,

15:00.710 --> 15:02.510
there are indeed many scammers.

15:02.810 --> 15:04.120
But this Master Song

15:04.590 --> 15:06.230
is a genuine master.

15:07.710 --> 15:09.040
What makes you say that?

15:17.160 --> 15:17.840
Uncle Chen.

15:19.080 --> 15:19.920
I'm sorry.

15:20.110 --> 15:21.280
I apologize for my rudeness.

15:21.280 --> 15:23.280
Sorry to keep you all waiting.

15:25.040 --> 15:26.920
You must be President Chen.

15:27.400 --> 15:29.000
I've heard so much about you.

15:29.110 --> 15:30.470
I've long heard of your great name.

15:30.470 --> 15:31.630
After I see you today,

15:31.630 --> 15:33.680
you truly live up to your reputation.

15:33.680 --> 15:34.680
You flatter me.

15:34.830 --> 15:36.990
I am just a wanderer.

15:37.060 --> 15:38.460
And you are?

15:39.990 --> 15:40.990
This is—

15:40.990 --> 15:41.710
Mr. Song,

15:42.510 --> 15:44.080
this is my Four Pillars of Destiny.

15:44.080 --> 15:45.810
Please perform some readings.

15:47.590 --> 15:49.090
This is your Four Pillars of Destiny?

15:49.090 --> 15:49.610
Yes.

15:51.320 --> 15:53.320
According to my readings,

15:53.990 --> 15:54.630
you are

15:55.440 --> 15:56.920
not a local.

15:57.750 --> 16:01.320
And your father is a wealthy man.

16:09.330 --> 16:11.080
My father is obsessed
with the divination arts of the "I Ching."

16:11.080 --> 16:12.140
Influenced by him,

16:12.430 --> 16:15.080
I also know a little
about the Four Pillars and physiognomy.

16:15.080 --> 16:16.280
Recently, there is a matter

16:16.280 --> 16:17.590
that has been bothering me
for a long time.

16:17.590 --> 16:19.870
I can't figure it out,
no matter how hard I think.

16:19.870 --> 16:22.070
Could you please give me some guidance?

16:22.230 --> 16:22.920
Go ahead.

16:23.230 --> 16:24.630
According to ancient books,

16:24.630 --> 16:25.560
a broad forehead

16:25.560 --> 16:26.560
and a full‑rounded chin

16:26.560 --> 16:27.710
are signs of good fortune.

16:27.710 --> 16:29.560
To judge a person's wealth,
look at their nose.

16:29.560 --> 16:30.470
With a high bridge,

16:30.470 --> 16:31.440
a fleshy nose

16:31.560 --> 16:33.620
indicates a life of wealth and honor.

16:33.830 --> 16:36.230
But I see many mediocre people
on the street

16:36.350 --> 16:38.890
who have broad foreheads
and full‑rounded chins.

16:38.890 --> 16:40.130
And for dock workers

16:40.230 --> 16:41.330
and rickshaw pullers,

16:41.330 --> 16:43.130
many of them also have big noses.

16:43.470 --> 16:44.350
Why is that?

16:44.680 --> 16:45.630
Physiognomy

16:45.630 --> 16:48.110
is based on Metal, Wood,
Water, Fire, and Earth.

16:48.110 --> 16:49.200
For the Five Elements,

16:49.200 --> 16:50.530
the key is integration.

16:50.710 --> 16:52.740
Without integration,
if you judge just one part,

16:52.740 --> 16:54.470
how can you tell good or bad luck?

16:54.470 --> 16:55.880
Combining the Five Elements

16:55.880 --> 16:57.170
is the right way.

16:58.350 --> 16:58.920
Master,

16:59.220 --> 17:00.580
I have a favor to ask.

17:00.910 --> 17:01.660
My father

17:01.680 --> 17:03.870
wants to invest in minerals here.

17:04.030 --> 17:05.510
But there are many minerals here,

17:05.510 --> 17:07.310
and we don't know where to start.

17:07.329 --> 17:08.990
Please give us some guidance.

17:09.599 --> 17:12.599
Divination is about
revealing the secrets of heaven.

17:12.599 --> 17:14.050
It can't be done lightly.

17:14.069 --> 17:17.200
But since we met here,

17:17.230 --> 17:18.510
it's fate.

17:18.530 --> 17:19.240
I

17:19.510 --> 17:20.880
will do my best.

17:23.990 --> 17:24.750
Sir,

17:25.960 --> 17:27.890
I can't go into details about this.

17:28.160 --> 17:30.440
But you must remember

17:30.640 --> 17:31.920
a few words.

17:44.090 --> 17:44.850
All right.

17:45.070 --> 17:46.070
Time is up.

17:46.090 --> 17:47.850
Please leave.

17:52.330 --> 17:53.120
Uncle Chen.

17:57.230 --> 17:58.360
East of Mount Ping.

17:58.380 --> 18:00.100
North of the Hao River.

18:00.300 --> 18:01.850
Where the mountain ends, silver appears.

18:01.850 --> 18:04.240
Where the water runs out, gold emerges.

18:10.230 --> 18:12.960
There are 3 mines in total
on Mount Ping East Road.

18:13.120 --> 18:14.400
Two tin mines

18:14.450 --> 18:15.580
and one copper mine.

18:16.230 --> 18:17.510
The mines you found

18:17.770 --> 18:19.430
are indeed east of Mount Ping,

18:19.510 --> 18:21.200
but they are all on the south bank
of the Hao River.

18:21.200 --> 18:22.880
This is different from
what Master Song said.

18:22.880 --> 18:24.010
Because that old man

18:24.070 --> 18:25.600
was just talking nonsense.

18:25.750 --> 18:26.750
See for yourself.

18:27.190 --> 18:29.450
There are no mines north of the Hao River.

18:32.790 --> 18:33.360
Then...

18:34.600 --> 18:35.530
what about here?

18:35.770 --> 18:36.570
This won't do.

18:36.990 --> 18:38.600
This is a famous cursed mine nearby.

18:38.600 --> 18:40.310
There have been many accidents.

18:40.310 --> 18:42.290
This mine has changed hands several times.

18:42.290 --> 18:43.370
It's completely abandoned now.

18:43.370 --> 18:45.230
No one would take it even for free.

18:45.310 --> 18:46.400
I didn't expect

18:46.960 --> 18:48.070
you to know so much.

18:49.410 --> 18:51.610
Even though my daddy and I always argue,

18:52.230 --> 18:53.310
locating ore veins
and pinpointing deposits

18:53.310 --> 18:54.700
is our family's ancestral craft,

18:54.700 --> 18:57.230
and he has been teaching me
since I was a child.

19:01.480 --> 19:02.570
Then can you

19:03.040 --> 19:04.600
go take a look here with me?

19:13.440 --> 19:14.750
I was right, wasn't I?

19:15.130 --> 19:16.200
Look at this mine.

19:16.230 --> 19:18.360
It's been abandoned for so many years.

19:21.240 --> 19:23.370
Let's go inside and take another look.

19:47.600 --> 19:48.560
Come look.

19:49.730 --> 19:50.360
We've already

19:50.360 --> 19:51.750
gone down that deep,

19:51.750 --> 19:53.120
and it's still just rock walls.

19:53.120 --> 19:54.030
This means

19:54.070 --> 19:56.400
this mine is almost completely mined out.

19:56.440 --> 19:57.440
So if you ask me,

19:57.710 --> 19:59.060
even if this isn't a cursed mine,

19:59.060 --> 20:01.190
there's no need for you to invest in it.

20:01.430 --> 20:04.040
But Master Song
can't be wrong in his divination.

20:04.040 --> 20:05.510
Then let him go down with you.

20:05.510 --> 20:06.400
I'm done.

20:06.810 --> 20:07.670
Wait a minute.

20:09.270 --> 20:10.560
Have you heard

20:11.270 --> 20:12.360
that sound?

20:36.350 --> 20:37.320
It's fine.

20:38.160 --> 20:39.220
They all flew away.

20:54.510 --> 20:55.230
Who is it?

20:56.310 --> 20:57.120
Who's there?

20:58.320 --> 20:59.270
You scared me.

21:01.590 --> 21:03.790
What are you two doing in my mine?

21:05.990 --> 21:06.600
Mr. Hu,

21:06.960 --> 21:07.640
how much

21:07.960 --> 21:09.550
are you planning
to sell this tin mine for?

21:09.550 --> 21:10.960
If you sincerely want it,

21:11.340 --> 21:13.000
I'll give you one fixed price.

21:14.470 --> 21:15.140
Ten thousand.

21:15.140 --> 21:15.670
How much?

21:15.840 --> 21:16.400
Ten thousand.

21:16.400 --> 21:17.510
Are you crazy?

21:17.680 --> 21:19.990
Even owners of rich mines
only ask for this price.

21:19.990 --> 21:21.990
Your mine is almost dug dry,

21:21.990 --> 21:23.640
and it's been abandoned for so many years.

21:23.640 --> 21:25.500
Why are you asking for this price?

21:26.140 --> 21:28.220
I think this girl makes sense.

21:28.360 --> 21:29.890
Then let's leave it at that.

21:30.020 --> 21:31.420
I'm not selling the mine.

21:31.760 --> 21:32.560
Wait a minute.

21:50.920 --> 21:51.710
Mr. Hu.

21:52.470 --> 21:54.480
This is a check
from Standard Chartered Bank.

21:54.480 --> 21:55.570
Sign the contract,

21:55.920 --> 21:57.230
and you can withdraw the money today.

21:57.230 --> 21:57.920
Okay.

21:58.000 --> 21:58.840
Wait a minute.

21:59.400 --> 22:00.550
Are you crazy too?

22:01.840 --> 22:02.920
I guarantee you,

22:03.270 --> 22:04.510
if you buy this mine,

22:04.640 --> 22:06.700
you'll definitely lose everything.

22:08.840 --> 22:09.750
Don't worry.

22:10.470 --> 22:11.870
I've thought it through.

22:18.160 --> 22:18.840
Mr. Hu.

22:19.430 --> 22:21.760
-To our cooperation
-To our cooperation.

22:30.130 --> 22:33.290
That Hu Guangyuan looked like a profiteer.

22:33.750 --> 22:35.220
Since Shengxiang bought his mine,

22:35.220 --> 22:37.420
he's definitely going to suffer a loss.

22:38.790 --> 22:39.460
Qingying.

22:40.020 --> 22:42.150
Don't you understand by now?

22:43.510 --> 22:44.520
Understand what?

22:45.200 --> 22:46.710
Hu Guangyuan who sells the mine

22:46.710 --> 22:48.270
and Song Tiezui

22:48.440 --> 22:50.440
are actually in cahoots.

22:51.880 --> 22:53.160
I even suspect

22:53.180 --> 22:55.790
that Lin Shengxiang
is involved with them too.

22:56.160 --> 22:58.680
The act these people have been putting on
these past few days

22:58.680 --> 23:00.640
is just a scheme against me.

23:01.210 --> 23:02.140
No way.

23:02.510 --> 23:03.910
You're overthinking it.

23:04.070 --> 23:06.440
Because he believed
a fortune teller's words,

23:06.440 --> 23:09.200
he spent 10,000 silver dollars
on an abandoned mine.

23:09.200 --> 23:11.440
This kind of person
is either a complete fool

23:11.440 --> 23:13.440
or a master of some bigger scheme.

23:13.810 --> 23:14.770
Think about it.

23:15.230 --> 23:16.180
From the moment we met,

23:16.180 --> 23:18.460
he kept mentioning Song Tiezui.

23:18.640 --> 23:20.530
It was clearly intentional.

23:20.840 --> 23:21.790
No way.

23:22.070 --> 23:24.550
I actually hope this kid Lin Shengxiang

23:24.550 --> 23:26.400
is a complete fool.

23:26.880 --> 23:27.640
Why?

23:27.960 --> 23:30.510
He spent that much money
on an abandoned mine.

23:30.710 --> 23:31.840
If we do business with him,

23:31.840 --> 23:33.230
we certainly won't take a loss.

23:33.230 --> 23:34.030
Daddy.

23:35.230 --> 23:36.310
Let me tell you,

23:36.470 --> 23:39.070
don't get any ideas
about this Lin Shengxiang.

23:39.160 --> 23:42.120
I will never allow
my son-in-law to be a fool!

23:43.400 --> 23:44.120
Master Hu,

23:44.550 --> 23:45.680
I just feel like

23:46.030 --> 23:46.990
our act

23:47.680 --> 23:48.840
is a bit overdone.

23:49.200 --> 23:49.960
Is that so?

23:50.680 --> 23:51.610
Tell me about it.

23:52.530 --> 23:55.240
Buying such an abandoned mine
for 10,000 silver dollars.

23:55.240 --> 23:57.230
Chen Jiarong has been in business
for so many years.

23:57.230 --> 24:00.490
He will definitely think
there's something wrong with us.

24:00.600 --> 24:01.750
That's not wrong.

24:02.040 --> 24:03.900
There's something wrong with us.

24:05.680 --> 24:07.540
Then how can I make him believe me?

24:08.790 --> 24:09.840
You said it yourself.

24:09.840 --> 24:11.570
He's been in business for so many years.

24:11.570 --> 24:13.120
An old fox like him

24:13.230 --> 24:15.200
will never easily trust anyone.

24:17.120 --> 24:19.120
I'm getting more and more confused.

24:21.420 --> 24:22.500
Remember, kid,

24:22.680 --> 24:24.140
I'm teaching you for free.

24:25.160 --> 24:27.120
When you put in enough effort,

24:27.640 --> 24:28.230
people

24:28.440 --> 24:30.270
will deceive themselves.

24:30.550 --> 24:32.030
So you have to

24:32.230 --> 24:33.710
keep putting on this act.

24:35.070 --> 24:36.470
Hurry up, put some effort into it!

24:36.470 --> 24:36.920
-Got it!
-Got it!

24:36.920 --> 24:38.510
Get that machine running!

24:39.030 --> 24:39.960
Hurry up.

24:40.230 --> 24:41.080
Come on.

24:41.680 --> 24:42.770
Put some effort into it.

24:42.770 --> 24:43.330
Mr. Hu,

24:43.680 --> 24:44.480
they're here.

24:46.200 --> 24:46.890
Mr. Lin.

24:46.950 --> 24:47.520
Come,

24:47.540 --> 24:48.400
please come in.

24:49.200 --> 24:50.200
Come, Mr. Lin.

24:50.230 --> 24:51.490
Come in and have a seat.

24:53.790 --> 24:54.680
Mr. Hu,

24:54.880 --> 24:57.030
we're officially taking over
the tin mine tomorrow.

24:57.030 --> 24:58.360
What do you mean

24:58.680 --> 25:00.080
by calling us here today?

25:00.310 --> 25:01.380
No rush.

25:01.710 --> 25:02.640
Sit down and rest for a while.

25:02.640 --> 25:04.730
Have some water, and let's take our time.

25:04.730 --> 25:06.290
No need to be so polite with us.

25:06.290 --> 25:07.320
If you have something to say,

25:07.320 --> 25:08.320
just say it.

25:09.200 --> 25:09.990
Alright.

25:10.070 --> 25:12.270
Then I'll be straightforward, Mr. Lin.

25:12.270 --> 25:13.470
I don't want to sell

25:13.960 --> 25:15.020
this mine anymore.

25:17.230 --> 25:18.440
What are you talking about?

25:18.440 --> 25:19.600
The contract has been signed,

25:19.600 --> 25:20.400
and the money has been paid.

25:20.400 --> 25:21.350
Are you backing out now?

25:21.350 --> 25:24.350
I will refund every penny to you,

25:24.530 --> 25:25.600
but the contract

25:25.920 --> 25:26.400
is void.

25:26.400 --> 25:27.510
Are you kidding me?

25:27.510 --> 25:28.240
Shengxiang,

25:28.690 --> 25:30.580
let's hear Mr. Hu out first.

25:30.840 --> 25:32.200
I'm very sorry,

25:32.320 --> 25:33.080
Mr. Lin.

25:33.360 --> 25:35.790
You gave me a check
for 10,000 silver dollars.

25:35.790 --> 25:37.880
I'm returning it to you untouched.

25:38.070 --> 25:39.440
As an apology,

25:39.680 --> 25:40.360
I am

25:41.030 --> 25:41.840
adding

25:41.960 --> 25:44.030
2,000 silver dollars in cash.

25:44.120 --> 25:45.550
Here is your check.

25:45.790 --> 25:48.110
A total of 12,000 silver dollars.

25:48.400 --> 25:49.860
Think about it carefully.

25:49.920 --> 25:50.640
Mr. Hu,

25:51.030 --> 25:52.470
tell me the truth.

25:52.680 --> 25:53.920
What exactly happened

25:53.920 --> 25:55.360
with your tin mine?

25:55.470 --> 25:57.880
Nothing happened.

25:57.900 --> 25:59.880
I just don't want to sell it anymore.

25:59.880 --> 26:00.790
Mr. Lin,

26:00.960 --> 26:02.360
take the 12,000 silver dollars

26:02.360 --> 26:04.030
and leave.

26:04.230 --> 26:04.960
Impossible!

26:04.990 --> 26:05.990
The contract has been signed.

26:05.990 --> 26:07.850
You can't just back out like that.

26:09.400 --> 26:10.990
Then I'll tell you.

26:11.160 --> 26:13.400
This is my territory.

26:13.680 --> 26:15.200
I can back out

26:15.220 --> 26:17.110
if I want to.

26:18.030 --> 26:18.680
Men!

26:19.920 --> 26:20.790
Come here!

26:20.850 --> 26:21.610
Hurry up!

26:24.640 --> 26:25.380
Are you scared?

26:25.380 --> 26:26.540
Can you take them?

26:26.670 --> 26:27.430
Shengxiang,

26:27.910 --> 26:28.550
let's go.

26:29.290 --> 26:29.920
Go.

26:33.120 --> 26:34.120
Mr. Lin,

26:34.120 --> 26:37.120
even if you don't take the money,
the contract is void.

26:41.980 --> 26:43.180
Not selling anymore?

26:46.230 --> 26:47.120
Why?

26:47.320 --> 26:48.470
He didn't say why.

26:48.710 --> 26:50.510
He even paid another 2,000 silver dollars

26:50.510 --> 26:51.570
to Lin Shengxiang,

26:51.960 --> 26:54.360
as long as he agreed
to cancel the contract.

26:56.120 --> 26:57.070
Did he agree?

26:57.310 --> 26:57.990
No.

26:58.100 --> 26:59.510
They almost got into a fight.

26:59.510 --> 27:01.640
A group of miners surrounded them.

27:04.030 --> 27:05.160
Send some men

27:05.160 --> 27:06.920
to ask around Mount Ping

27:07.230 --> 27:08.960
and see what's been going on

27:09.840 --> 27:11.470
at Hu's mine recently.

27:11.710 --> 27:12.400
Yes, Master.

27:12.400 --> 27:13.460
I'll go right away.

27:14.160 --> 27:15.840
I heard from Gui recently

27:16.440 --> 27:17.840
that you kept going out

27:18.230 --> 27:20.290
and were gone for a long time once out.

27:20.470 --> 27:21.600
What were you doing?

27:21.840 --> 27:23.070
The Pangzhou Jockey Club

27:23.070 --> 27:24.120
got a new horse.

27:24.440 --> 27:27.100
They said it's some famous
British royal horse.

27:27.360 --> 27:28.600
I got carried away

27:28.740 --> 27:30.140
and bet on 5 races in a row.

27:32.750 --> 27:34.400
You didn't win a single one.

27:34.420 --> 27:36.290
I even owe a loan shark
100 silver dollars.

27:36.290 --> 27:38.330
But he saw me in the newspaper,

27:38.590 --> 27:40.920
so he didn't make me leave any collateral.

27:43.360 --> 27:44.030
Master Hu,

27:44.640 --> 27:45.920
about my money,

27:46.200 --> 27:47.530
is it convenient for you

27:47.640 --> 27:48.770
to pay me in advance?

27:50.840 --> 27:52.750
You really think
you're a rich young master, don't you?

27:52.750 --> 27:54.350
It's normal for the son
of a Chinese tycoon

27:54.350 --> 27:56.180
to have some entertainment, isn't it?

27:56.180 --> 27:58.110
You are right, Mr. Lin.

27:58.230 --> 28:00.640
But the rule of the Tianxiang Sect

28:00.990 --> 28:02.400
is to settle the bill
after the job is done.

28:02.400 --> 28:03.570
No delays.

28:03.880 --> 28:05.120
As for advances,

28:05.160 --> 28:06.550
don't even ask.

28:08.160 --> 28:09.020
How about this?

28:10.030 --> 28:11.840
You play this last scene well,

28:12.510 --> 28:13.360
and I'll have Gui

28:13.360 --> 28:15.360
take you out for some fun.

28:16.030 --> 28:16.790
That works.

28:23.550 --> 28:24.200
Master,

28:24.550 --> 28:26.310
I thought of finding one of our own

28:26.310 --> 28:27.360
to disguise as a miner

28:27.360 --> 28:29.070
to ask around at Hu's mine.

28:29.230 --> 28:30.810
But when we got there, we found out

28:30.810 --> 28:32.340
they were no longer hiring.

28:32.360 --> 28:33.600
Then spend some money

28:33.910 --> 28:36.470
to buy off their miners
to scout the interior.

28:36.920 --> 28:39.710
I've already sent capable people
to investigate.

28:39.710 --> 28:40.790
He said the Hu family's mine

28:40.790 --> 28:42.850
started recruiting half a month ago.

28:42.960 --> 28:44.510
It's a famously poor-grade mine,

28:44.510 --> 28:46.310
so no one wanted to go at first.

28:46.600 --> 28:47.790
Later, Hu said

28:47.810 --> 28:49.670
he would add half a month's wages,

28:49.730 --> 28:51.200
and that's how he recruited some people.

28:51.200 --> 28:51.960
He wanted

28:51.960 --> 28:55.420
to dig up some more tin ore
and make a fortune before selling it.

28:57.490 --> 28:59.620
Then why did he stop selling it later?

28:59.920 --> 29:01.160
That miner said

29:01.230 --> 29:03.440
they worked overtime last night
and went down the mine.

29:03.440 --> 29:04.700
He saw with his own eyes

29:04.750 --> 29:07.080
that they dug up some things
from the mine,

29:07.200 --> 29:07.750
and

29:07.990 --> 29:09.650
in considerable quantities.

29:10.490 --> 29:11.540
What things?

29:16.880 --> 29:17.640
Uncle?

29:18.270 --> 29:19.200
Why are you here?

29:26.380 --> 29:28.620
That guy named Song was right.

29:28.790 --> 29:29.960
Where the mountain ends, silver appears.

29:29.960 --> 29:31.470
Where the water runs out, gold emerges.

29:31.470 --> 29:32.510
Hu's mine

29:32.680 --> 29:33.750
has produced gold!

29:45.000 --> 29:45.920
Men,

29:45.950 --> 29:47.190
grab your weapons!

29:56.750 --> 29:57.750
Mr. Chen,

29:58.440 --> 29:59.230
Mr. Lin,

29:59.470 --> 30:00.200
what are you doing?

30:00.200 --> 30:01.120
We agreed

30:01.790 --> 30:03.520
to take over the tin mine today.

30:08.110 --> 30:09.660
Mr. Chen, have some tea.

30:10.920 --> 30:11.640
Mr. Lin.

30:15.790 --> 30:16.710
Mr. Lin,

30:17.030 --> 30:17.990
before,

30:18.230 --> 30:19.360
it was my fault

30:19.710 --> 30:21.360
for selling you a poor‑grade mine

30:21.360 --> 30:22.960
for so little money.

30:23.160 --> 30:26.510
I'd been feeling uneasy
since I went back.

30:26.840 --> 30:28.640
You can't let me

30:28.640 --> 30:30.370
live the rest of my life in guilt

30:30.400 --> 30:33.200
and be forever tormented
by my conscience, right?

30:33.200 --> 30:34.230
I really

30:34.510 --> 30:36.510
can't sell this mine to you.

30:37.230 --> 30:38.120
Mr. Hu,

30:38.880 --> 30:40.550
what do you mean?

30:40.790 --> 30:41.600
Mr. Chen,

30:41.920 --> 30:43.710
didn't I just say it?

30:44.710 --> 30:46.030
It's a poor-grade mine.

30:46.030 --> 30:47.510
The tin is gone.

30:47.840 --> 30:49.310
I dug it all up.

30:49.470 --> 30:51.680
If Mr. Lin takes over this mine,

30:51.790 --> 30:54.640
he will lose everything.

30:54.840 --> 30:55.900
It doesn't matter.

30:55.960 --> 30:57.470
I've already spent the money.

30:57.470 --> 30:58.930
Even if I lose everything,

30:58.960 --> 31:00.220
I will never blame you.

31:03.840 --> 31:04.470
Master.

31:07.120 --> 31:09.160
Can't you see I'm talking
to the two bosses?

31:09.160 --> 31:09.640
Leave!

31:09.980 --> 31:10.740
Stop!

31:16.840 --> 31:17.880
Wait, Mr. Chen,

31:18.030 --> 31:18.440
Young Master Lin,

31:18.440 --> 31:19.500
what are you doing?

31:19.950 --> 31:20.950
What are we doing?

31:21.400 --> 31:22.530
Still playing dumb?

31:23.310 --> 31:25.710
Don't you know what was dug up

31:25.730 --> 31:27.160
in Young Master Lin's mine?

31:27.160 --> 31:27.890
Shengxiang.

31:28.160 --> 31:29.490
Wait, Young Master Lin.

31:41.070 --> 31:41.800
As expected.

31:42.470 --> 31:43.400
Where the mountain ends, silver appears.

31:43.400 --> 31:44.680
Where the water runs out, gold emerges.

31:44.680 --> 31:46.340
Whatever it produces is mine!

31:46.390 --> 31:48.320
I'm not selling this mine anymore.

31:48.400 --> 31:48.920
Why?

31:49.200 --> 31:51.270
Are you going to rob me in broad daylight?

31:51.270 --> 31:53.440
It's clearly written in the contract.

31:53.710 --> 31:55.030
If you breach it,

31:55.440 --> 31:57.700
you shall pay 10 times the compensation.

31:57.920 --> 31:58.990
That is...

31:59.550 --> 32:00.950
100,000 silver dollars.

32:06.310 --> 32:08.310
If you want to play hardball,

32:08.580 --> 32:11.790
I'm well‑acquainted with the Sanhe Society
and the Chaozhou Gang.

32:11.790 --> 32:13.990
We can go head‑to‑head.

32:17.750 --> 32:18.600
Shengxiang,

32:19.270 --> 32:20.200
let's go.

32:26.160 --> 32:27.030
Wait a minute.

32:31.680 --> 32:32.360
Mr. Chen,

32:32.640 --> 32:34.600
I know your strength very well,

32:34.790 --> 32:36.270
but I haven't survived

32:36.270 --> 32:37.870
all these years for nothing.

32:38.600 --> 32:39.200
Fine then,

32:39.400 --> 32:40.460
let's be straight.

32:40.790 --> 32:41.440
The tin

32:41.790 --> 32:42.360
is gone.

32:43.400 --> 32:45.930
Who would have thought
it would produce gold?

32:45.930 --> 32:47.930
I don't know how much it can produce,

32:48.230 --> 32:50.120
but judging from the ore vein,

32:50.510 --> 32:53.240
it's at least 200,000
to 300,000 silver dollars.

32:53.270 --> 32:54.440
If you want it,

32:54.600 --> 32:55.660
you must add money!

32:55.840 --> 32:56.710
150,000!

33:01.750 --> 33:03.210
150,000 is not gonna work.

33:03.600 --> 33:04.710
50,000 at most.

33:04.990 --> 33:06.200
If you don't agree,

33:06.600 --> 33:08.630
we can talk in another way.

33:09.550 --> 33:10.080
Let's go.

33:11.920 --> 33:12.640
100,000!

33:13.360 --> 33:14.680
Not a penny less!

33:23.310 --> 33:24.120
Uncle Chen,

33:24.340 --> 33:26.000
thanks for what you did today.

33:26.160 --> 33:26.920
Otherwise,

33:27.300 --> 33:29.430
Hu definitely wouldn't have given in.

33:31.130 --> 33:31.850
Such men

33:32.400 --> 33:33.720
are like hounds;

33:34.230 --> 33:37.310
they will not release their hold
when they catch wind of profit.

33:37.310 --> 33:38.070
You've still

33:38.270 --> 33:39.510
got a lot to learn.

33:41.070 --> 33:41.670
By the way,

33:42.230 --> 33:44.430
I didn't bring that much cash this time.

33:44.550 --> 33:46.070
Do you have a reliable bank

33:46.070 --> 33:47.070
to recommend?

33:47.990 --> 33:49.360
No need to find a bank.

33:49.790 --> 33:50.840
I'll pay for it.

33:51.310 --> 33:54.550
Let's just say
we're partners in this mine.

33:57.710 --> 33:58.270
Why?

33:59.070 --> 34:01.270
Reluctant to part with half the shares?

34:03.970 --> 34:05.170
Without you,

34:06.130 --> 34:08.260
I couldn't have gotten this gold mine.

34:09.670 --> 34:10.730
I'll listen to you.

34:12.150 --> 34:12.750
Fine then.

34:24.110 --> 34:24.969
The act is over.

34:25.150 --> 34:26.350
Where is my grandson?

34:28.360 --> 34:30.219
This is your grandson's address.

34:32.469 --> 34:33.730
Where is Jiang Feiyan?

34:34.590 --> 34:35.800
We set up every scam

34:35.989 --> 34:37.239
using coded signals.

34:37.989 --> 34:39.550
Once it was done, we split up.

34:39.550 --> 34:40.800
No further contact between us.

34:40.800 --> 34:42.400
Who set up the scam back then?

34:43.360 --> 34:44.239
I only know

34:45.110 --> 34:47.110
he was a hall-master-level figure.

34:47.710 --> 34:49.969
What about that blind man from back then?

34:54.670 --> 34:55.670
Come, be careful.

34:57.190 --> 34:57.590
Mom.

34:57.760 --> 34:58.360
Mom.

34:58.840 --> 34:59.570
You're back.

34:59.880 --> 35:00.920
We have a guest.

35:02.280 --> 35:03.110
This is Mr. Du,

35:03.130 --> 35:04.660
I told you about last time.

35:06.720 --> 35:08.380
The one who told your fortune?

35:08.920 --> 35:09.840
Mr. Du

35:10.110 --> 35:12.240
has come to our parts on his wanderings,

35:12.240 --> 35:13.040
so he came over

35:13.190 --> 35:15.190
to check on my old illness again.

35:16.550 --> 35:18.030
Can he even practice medicine?

35:18.030 --> 35:19.150
Yet he's taking your pulse.

35:19.150 --> 35:20.320
You can't say that.

35:20.470 --> 35:22.840
Mr. Du is a reincarnated immortal.

35:23.880 --> 35:26.550
I took Mr. Du's prescription before.

35:26.960 --> 35:27.990
At that time, my health

35:27.990 --> 35:29.240
improved a lot.

35:29.470 --> 35:31.720
Mountain, medicine, destiny,
physiognomy, and divination.

35:31.720 --> 35:32.920
In our line of work,

35:33.130 --> 35:36.070
we naturally need to know
some basic medical knowledge.

35:36.070 --> 35:37.670
Just tell me the truth.

35:38.590 --> 35:40.590
When you usually read
people's Four Pillars chart,

35:40.590 --> 35:42.470
do you just talk nonsense?

35:42.760 --> 35:43.880
You are mistaken.

35:45.030 --> 35:46.550
The so-called Four Pillars chart

35:46.550 --> 35:48.150
is just a person's birthday.

35:48.550 --> 35:50.080
Year, month, day, and time.

35:50.360 --> 35:52.030
Four pairs of Heavenly Stems
and Earthly Branches.

35:52.030 --> 35:53.360
Two characters per set,

35:53.470 --> 35:54.730
8 characters in total.

35:54.840 --> 35:56.240
Hence, it's called Bazi,

35:56.510 --> 35:58.240
also known as the Four Pillars.

35:58.670 --> 35:59.510
Nonsense.

35:59.840 --> 36:00.900
Then let me ask you.

36:00.990 --> 36:03.050
If two people have the same birthday,

36:03.150 --> 36:04.080
is their destiny

36:04.360 --> 36:05.470
the same too?

36:05.600 --> 36:06.830
Of course not.

36:07.440 --> 36:10.280
If we further refine each Hour Pillar,

36:10.510 --> 36:12.310
down to every quarter of an hour,

36:12.590 --> 36:15.240
the accuracy will be even higher.

36:15.920 --> 36:16.630
Of course,

36:16.730 --> 36:18.670
this would no longer
be Eight-Character fortune-telling,

36:18.670 --> 36:20.060
but Ten-Character fortune-telling.

36:20.060 --> 36:21.720
What if it's exactly the same?

36:21.880 --> 36:24.240
I was just talking about
the Four Pillars chart.

36:24.240 --> 36:26.280
The region and environment
where a person is born

36:26.280 --> 36:29.110
will also affect their fate.

36:30.320 --> 36:32.720
You might want to think about it
carefully.

36:32.960 --> 36:34.550
Some people are born

36:34.550 --> 36:36.240
in the warm and humid lands of Jiangnan.

36:36.240 --> 36:37.440
Some are born

36:37.440 --> 36:39.110
in the cold regions of the Northeast.

36:39.110 --> 36:39.960
Some are born—

36:39.960 --> 36:41.190
All right, all right.

36:41.470 --> 36:43.070
You're always right anyway.

36:43.800 --> 36:44.840
Enough nonsense.

36:45.590 --> 36:46.840
Tell my fortune.

36:48.190 --> 36:50.790
When Miss Feiyan
sent the wedding invitation,

36:50.800 --> 36:51.760
I already

36:52.030 --> 36:54.030
read your Four Pillars charts.

36:54.360 --> 36:55.560
What did you find out?

36:57.920 --> 36:59.840
Since you don't believe in fate,

36:59.880 --> 37:01.470
I have nothing more to say.

37:01.800 --> 37:04.600
If you are accurate,
I will naturally believe you.

37:04.960 --> 37:06.880
After I read your Four Pillars chart,

37:06.880 --> 37:08.740
you lack two of the Five Elements.

37:08.990 --> 37:10.120
As for your parents,

37:10.360 --> 37:12.020
one of them passed away early.

37:12.110 --> 37:14.430
Fire runs excessive and baleful
in your chart,

37:14.430 --> 37:17.290
and Miss Feiyan's chart
is marked by baleful Water.

37:17.440 --> 37:19.510
Water and Fire
are inherently incompatible.

37:19.510 --> 37:22.190
If you two insist on being together,

37:22.400 --> 37:25.130
your family will surely
suffer a great disaster.

37:26.880 --> 37:28.080
What great disaster?

37:30.960 --> 37:32.110
Within a month,

37:32.840 --> 37:34.370
your whole family will die.

37:45.190 --> 37:46.230
Dad.

37:51.360 --> 37:52.400
Recently,

37:52.880 --> 37:55.470
Master had been coughing up blood.

37:55.800 --> 37:57.330
We consulted many doctors,

37:57.420 --> 37:58.910
but none of them helped.

37:59.260 --> 38:00.180
Last night,

38:00.720 --> 38:01.760
he finally

38:01.870 --> 38:03.630
couldn't hold on anymore.

38:04.070 --> 38:05.870
Before your father passed away,

38:08.240 --> 38:10.070
he kept calling your name.

38:11.630 --> 38:12.440
He said

38:13.150 --> 38:15.010
he left the family business to you

38:15.030 --> 38:17.160
and wanted you to support this family.

38:17.590 --> 38:19.660
Dad!

38:45.880 --> 38:46.480
Jialiang,

38:47.550 --> 38:48.760
take the cricket out.

38:49.670 --> 38:50.200
Brother,

38:50.400 --> 38:51.800
Marshal Jin is just hungry.

38:51.800 --> 38:54.030
Feed it some food, and it won't chirp.

38:54.550 --> 38:55.360
Be good.

38:56.360 --> 38:58.020
Don't disturb our dad's rest.

38:58.030 --> 38:59.690
Marshal Jin is very obedient.

38:59.800 --> 39:02.030
It won't be noisy when it's full.

39:02.280 --> 39:02.820
Jialiang,

39:02.820 --> 39:03.930
listen to your brother.

39:03.930 --> 39:04.780
Take it out.

39:06.030 --> 39:06.630
Jialiang,

39:07.070 --> 39:07.800
give it to me.

39:08.630 --> 39:09.280
Take it out.

39:09.280 --> 39:09.960
Be good.

39:10.920 --> 39:11.760
Give it to me.

39:11.760 --> 39:12.840
Give it to your brother.

39:12.840 --> 39:14.670
Jialiang.

39:14.920 --> 39:15.280
Be good.

39:15.280 --> 39:15.630
Jialiang.

39:15.630 --> 39:16.400
Be good.

39:16.470 --> 39:17.030
Jialiang.

39:17.030 --> 39:17.880
Give it to your brother.

39:17.880 --> 39:18.280
Jia...

39:18.830 --> 39:20.350
Marshal Jin!

39:23.720 --> 39:26.990
Stop crying.

39:30.630 --> 39:31.360
Stepmother,

39:31.930 --> 39:33.930
take them back to their room to rest.

39:35.110 --> 39:35.640
Let's go.

39:35.670 --> 39:37.130
Go back to the room with me.

39:39.840 --> 39:40.700
No more crying.

40:11.180 --> 40:13.310
You haven't eaten anything all night.

40:13.510 --> 40:15.110
Come and have some porridge.

40:22.440 --> 40:23.070
Jiaxian,

40:23.590 --> 40:24.990
get up and eat something.

40:29.880 --> 40:30.940
Careful.

40:37.400 --> 40:38.200
Young Master!

40:38.630 --> 40:39.510
Young Master!

40:40.470 --> 40:41.270
Young Master.

40:41.440 --> 40:42.510
Jialiang and Jiashu

40:42.510 --> 40:43.470
are missing.

40:43.850 --> 40:44.370
What?

40:44.400 --> 40:46.530
They sneaked out early in the morning,

40:46.670 --> 40:48.150
and we still haven't found them.

40:48.150 --> 40:49.070
Someone saw them

40:49.070 --> 40:49.990
heading towards

40:49.990 --> 40:51.440
the South Mountain.

40:51.760 --> 40:55.020
The Second Madam
has already taken people to look for them.

40:56.590 --> 40:57.850
Don't worry, Jiaxian.

41:01.340 --> 41:02.260
Jialiang!

41:02.960 --> 41:03.470
Jiashu!

41:03.470 --> 41:04.110
Jialiang!

41:05.030 --> 41:05.800
Jiashu!

41:06.550 --> 41:07.470
Young Master.

41:07.720 --> 41:08.520
Young Master.

41:08.920 --> 41:09.880
We've looked everywhere,

41:09.880 --> 41:11.190
but still can't find them.

41:11.190 --> 41:13.670
I heard Master Du
at the Immortal Temple is very capable.

41:13.670 --> 41:15.150
Maybe he has a way.

41:21.550 --> 41:22.280
Mr. Du,

41:22.790 --> 41:23.750
my brother is 5,

41:24.840 --> 41:26.190
and my sister is only 6.

41:26.960 --> 41:28.110
You must save them.

41:28.580 --> 41:29.870
It's a sin.

41:30.240 --> 41:31.070
It's a sin.

41:31.360 --> 41:32.550
It's all my fault.

41:32.840 --> 41:34.370
As long as they can be saved,

41:34.750 --> 41:36.080
even if it costs my life,

41:36.840 --> 41:37.700
I'll accept it.

41:37.840 --> 41:39.400
The Great Dao holds 50;

41:39.840 --> 41:41.400
Heaven evolves 49 of them,

41:41.550 --> 41:43.190
and humankind escapes the one.

41:43.190 --> 41:44.470
I can only

41:44.760 --> 41:45.960
do my best.

41:46.880 --> 41:49.470
Thank you.

42:03.370 --> 42:04.830
Mind returns to its place.

42:06.440 --> 42:07.840
Free from distractions.

42:09.100 --> 42:10.750
Slay demons and bind evil.

42:17.720 --> 42:20.110
Save thousands of people.

42:32.630 --> 42:33.360
Jialiang.

42:35.560 --> 42:36.210
Jiashu.

42:37.050 --> 42:38.250
They're my younger brother and sister.

42:38.250 --> 42:39.210
Wait!

42:40.240 --> 42:42.920
How dare you be insolent
before the Immortal Elder?

42:42.920 --> 42:45.920
Aren't you afraid your siblings'
souls will scatter?

42:46.030 --> 42:47.230
Then what should I do?

42:47.720 --> 42:48.990
Please advise me.

42:49.190 --> 42:52.360
You have repeatedly offended
the immortal's majesty.

42:52.380 --> 42:54.940
Hurry up and kneel
before the Immortal Elder

42:55.240 --> 42:57.440
to beg for forgiveness.

42:59.590 --> 43:01.190
I am guilty.

43:01.800 --> 43:03.030
The guilt is mine alone.

43:03.030 --> 43:03.720
Let them go.

43:03.960 --> 43:04.620
Let them go.

43:04.960 --> 43:05.620
I am guilty.

43:06.090 --> 43:06.800
I am guilty.

43:07.030 --> 43:08.670
I originally thought

43:08.670 --> 43:11.760
your brother and sister
were just ordinary children.

43:11.960 --> 43:13.280
Now it seems

43:13.440 --> 43:16.630
they actually possess
an immortal affinity.

43:18.110 --> 43:19.070
What do you mean?

43:19.240 --> 43:20.510
What you see now

43:20.750 --> 43:23.100
is but a clay‑formed avatar

43:23.120 --> 43:24.880
they left behind in the mortal world.

43:24.880 --> 43:26.950
Their souls are naturally not here.

43:27.320 --> 43:28.360
Then where are they?

43:28.360 --> 43:30.550
The Southern Immortal Elder
wants to take them

43:30.550 --> 43:31.810
as immortal children.

43:31.920 --> 43:34.110
How can we mortals stop it?

43:34.440 --> 43:35.190
No way.

43:36.240 --> 43:37.110
No way.

43:37.110 --> 43:37.840
No way.

43:38.320 --> 43:39.670
Help them.

43:39.670 --> 43:41.240
Help them, Master.

43:41.340 --> 43:44.260
How dare mortals oppose the immortals?

43:44.630 --> 43:46.760
I'll accept whatever price I have to pay.

43:46.760 --> 43:48.360
As long as they can come back.

43:48.630 --> 43:49.320
All right.

43:49.390 --> 43:50.320
Fine.

43:51.880 --> 43:53.280
I'll help you all the way.

43:53.630 --> 43:54.950
Since I promised you,

43:55.150 --> 43:56.550
I might as well try again.

43:59.400 --> 44:02.000
Thank you.

44:02.030 --> 44:04.840
To know the whereabouts
of the two children,

44:04.950 --> 44:07.210
we must beg the Immortal Elder for mercy.

44:08.030 --> 44:10.840
But I heard that this Immortal Temple

44:10.840 --> 44:12.340
has few worshippers,

44:12.370 --> 44:13.630
showing disrespect for the immortal.

44:13.630 --> 44:15.510
It's in disrepair,

44:15.510 --> 44:17.040
and the statues are ruined.

44:17.110 --> 44:18.570
It's utterly outrageous!

44:18.990 --> 44:21.240
I am willing to give up my family business

44:21.240 --> 44:22.900
and abandon everything I have

44:23.190 --> 44:24.450
to renovate the temple

44:25.120 --> 44:26.920
and remold his gold-leaf statue

44:26.960 --> 44:28.190
for the Immortal Elder.

44:28.190 --> 44:30.070
It's never too late

44:30.110 --> 44:31.540
to mend your ways.

44:31.720 --> 44:32.580
How about this?

44:32.710 --> 44:34.400
First, go raise
the incense‑offering donations

44:34.400 --> 44:36.150
according to this figure.

44:40.360 --> 44:43.720
Thank you.

44:43.720 --> 44:45.720
Wait for me.

44:51.360 --> 44:53.760
You fortune-tellers

44:53.920 --> 44:54.840
are all liars!

44:58.380 --> 44:59.050
Jialiang

44:59.470 --> 45:00.280
and Jiashu

45:00.670 --> 45:02.840
are dead!

45:03.760 --> 45:04.760
It was me

45:05.110 --> 45:06.720
who got your father killed.

45:07.400 --> 45:08.670
Your wife

45:08.940 --> 45:09.790
left

45:10.880 --> 45:11.720
alone.

45:14.240 --> 45:15.760
Judging from your physiognomy,

45:15.760 --> 45:17.220
you still have a long life.

45:17.510 --> 45:18.510
You won't die today.
